Provenance:
- Base binaries and build source from the SimtFont-v0.200 distribution archive.
- The committed font binaries are the archive's TTF/WOFF files with only the
  name table changed: typographic family name (ID 12), license (ID 13) and
  license URL (ID 14) entries declaring the SIL Open Font License were added,
  and the head table's checkSumAdjustment and modified fields were updated by
  fontTools 4.69.1. Every other table is byte-identical to the archive.

The font's parametric build source (sources/) reproduces the glyphs; it requires
Python 3.10+ and the pinned fontTools dependency. Rebuild with `./sources/build.sh`
from simt-font/.
